# =====================================================================
#  common.map - general phishing phrases (installed for every sector)
#  Part of: phishing-detector by Develust Technology
#
#  Format : one regex per line, /pattern/flags
#  Flags  : i = case-insensitive, u = UTF-8 (needed for non-Latin text)
#  Note   : PHISH_TEXT scores 0 alone; it only adds points together
#           with a phishing link (PHISH_URL / PHISHING), so phrases
#           can be a bit broader than a standalone rule.
#  Rules  : no trailing spaces (Rspamd 4.x ignores such lines silently)
#
#  Themes : mailbox full / quota, password expiry, account verification,
#           account suspension, unusual sign-in, shared documents,
#           pending messages, voicemail, payment problems, parcel
#           delivery, tax refund / overdue payment
#
#  Languages: English, Spanish, German, French, Italian, Portuguese,
#             Dutch, Polish, Turkish, Azerbaijani, Russian, Ukrainian,
#             Arabic, Hindi, Chinese, Thai
# =====================================================================

# ===== English =====
